  "thought_summary": "需要检查 is_valid_parenthesization 函数的实现，以确定其是否正确处理只有未闭合左括号的字符串。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "inspect_code",
    "arguments": {
      "file_path": "is_valid_parenthesization.py",
      "start_line": 1,
      "context_lines": 20
    }
  }
}

content:
{
  "thought_summary": "发现 is_valid_parenthesization 函数在遍历字符串后返回 True，但未检查深度是否为零，导致只有未闭合左括号的字符串被错误判断为有效。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "apply_patch",
    "arguments": {
      "patch_text": "--- a/is_valid_parenthesization.py\n+++ b/is_valid_parenthesization.py\n@@ -11 +11 @@\n-    return True\n+    return depth == 0"
    }
  }
}
